  "registration": "The four-view board locks one Modern Fire Station - Deconstructivist Concrete with 52 m by 36 m, three occupied levels; three unobstructed deep apparatus portals occupy the left concrete hall while a ground-to-roof charcoal crew wing and sheltered public entry complete the right side of the front, one tapered and visibly grounded hose tower leans above the roof with a narrow slit, and every angled wall owns real thickness and closed returns. The fixed landmark consumes that complete topology; LEGO fallback modules repeat only audited ordinary middle bays.",
